"""Build the T3 RAG pack (smoke and aerosol detection: SAME, SAME-R, DAFT) from the T3 package.

    python analysis/T3/extra/build_rag_pack.py        (run from the kit root)

Writes analysis/T3/extra/rag_pack_T3.txt and, when the folder exists, ../RAG/Mahmoud.txt.
Format follows the team's RAG packs: every chunk starts with
'### [CHUNK <id>] <title> | source: <S-ids> | tags: <tags>' and is self-contained.
All numbers are read from the package files (findings.md, tables/derived_*.csv/json, cards);
only the NASA page texts in PSI_TEXT were copied from the PSI pages (2026-11-15).
"""
